# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in every checkout, on every OS.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) writes CRLF into the
# working tree while the blobs stay LF, and every cross-machine diff turns into
# a phantom whole-file rewrite.  Portability is a hard requirement here: the
# same bytes must come out of a macOS, Linux and Windows checkout alike.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Content that must stay byte-exact.
*.pdf    binary
*.png    binary
*.olean  binary
*.ilean  binary
*.trace  binary
